{"posts":[{"id":"alex_p15_351","t":"Hi Alex, can you help me please? Its about DP on your chart. Excuse my bad english.","a":"bobyv87","d":"","n":"#351","p":15,"im":[],"m":351},{"id":"alex_p15_352","t":"Hi. I love style of Trade: - From KEY SWING to KEY SWING, From Key DP to Key DP using KEY S\\R, Swap Level, example - hereinbelow.\n\nRegarding your quistions:","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#352","p":15,"im":["36c7d48105ea9ccbfc6ec9ee0164ee14513093d7","01dbf2cc09fed6f39f9a7d349bc5761a3affa9a2","ccff9d6dda36329d71fa34ecf81879a473c1f37f"],"m":352},{"id":"alex_p15_353","t":"I added some details in IF`s chart a little ( how I love to trade) Everybody has own style of trade using knowledge of RTM site.","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#353","p":15,"im":["97bb6994c9c96e410e28d16767208ff747da1d27"],"m":353},{"id":"alex_p15_354","t":"Alex, Thanks so much for these recent charts you have posted, They help me see things in a simple way. I look at your examples and they make perfect sense, but I try to find something similar and I freeze.... I will post a chart later...","a":"parnelli","d":"","n":"#354","p":15,"im":[],"m":354},{"id":"alex_p15_355","t":"Promised chart, Comments welcome\n\nMaybe not the best example, but I wanted to pick a random chart and work off that, that's the real world.... I know a chart is a chart but I like the higher time frames, I need to trade with PO'S due to my schedule.....","a":"parnelli","d":"","n":"#355","p":15,"im":["66f48134e616c4dbf6fc90657c4ff50694691392"],"m":355},{"id":"alex_p15_356","t":"Nice chart. I added some details, When price is moving to Key level, it is important to look for then - FLAG, QM, ENG, DP,DM, Can Can, FL -to find the best entry (HTF+LTF). In this chart - super Flag + QM.","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#356","p":15,"im":["327ea86c5e81bec7b7d86b55bd07669f403fbb35"],"m":356},{"id":"alex_p15_357","t":"Woww, thank you Alex. Your last charts really helped me to understand the importance of Key Levels. If, in his videos speaks several times about FTR after a BIG engulf. Big engulf means that price its engulfed a Key level. Now, If we have a Flag that is broken south in monthly Tf we drop in the lower TF's and we see this flag ranging between two Keylevels. Each Tf have his own KLs. Im alright?\n\nKovalenko wrote: Nice chart. I added some details, When price is moving to Key level, it is important to look for then - FLAG, QM, ENG, DP,DM, Can Can, FL -to find the best entry (HTF+LTF). In this chart - super Flag + QM.","a":"bobyv87","d":"","n":"#357","p":15,"im":["327ea86c5e81bec7b7d86b55bd07669f403fbb35"],"m":357},{"id":"alex_p15_358","t":"Yes. Every timeframe has own key level","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#358","p":15,"im":[],"m":358},{"id":"alex_p15_359","t":"Kovalenko wrote: Hi. I love style of Trade: - From KEY SWING to KEY SWING, From Key DP to Key DP using KEY S\\R, Swap Level, example - hereinbelow.\n\nThank you so much for your charts - I learned a lot from them - mainly where the key areas are","a":"hansma","d":"","n":"#359","p":15,"im":["36c7d48105ea9ccbfc6ec9ee0164ee14513093d7","01dbf2cc09fed6f39f9a7d349bc5761a3affa9a2","ccff9d6dda36329d71fa34ecf81879a473c1f37f"],"m":359},{"id":"alex_p15_360","t":"Tried to put my newly learned skills to a test on a chart.\n\nHowever I ran into some questions (posted on the chart) any help from the pros will be highly appreciated\n\nThanks Hans","a":"hansma","d":"","n":"#360","p":15,"im":["3b1912b66ffb773381b6355478648d8427305926"],"m":360},{"id":"alex_p15_361","t":"Always follow the market","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#361","p":15,"im":["dcbe7f78e17d053a2bfccab77381f856cb8541ca"],"m":361},{"id":"alex_p15_362","t":"This is how i see it. Im a little bit confused. You sometimes consider a key level a local low and other times a low from other leg up. This is the chart. Thank you!","a":"bobyv87","d":"","n":"#362","p":15,"im":["ff060e1730ec6e973f53c7ebff187d04a1cd2336"],"m":362},{"id":"alex_p15_363","t":"The Green flag is where I'm having trouble, the flag was ignored on both sides so I cant see what the significance is... I'm sure that's what the IT\"s want\n\nKovalenko wrote: Always follow the market","a":"parnelli","d":"","n":"#363","p":15,"im":["dcbe7f78e17d053a2bfccab77381f856cb8541ca"],"m":363},{"id":"alex_p15_364","t":"Hi Bobyv87, I expected this quistion exactly from you see, I pointed red (strong down movement), for me - it`s nice new DP. This new DP was engulfed, that`s why I pointed possible entry (stop loss - was max 10 pips -aggressive entry). Don`t forget - DP is fresh, if it was not retrace there.","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#364","p":15,"im":[],"m":364},{"id":"alex_p15_365","t":"trade was closed last week","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#365","p":15,"im":["706ad627bdf723ee6db3ba84ea2a732a4fc8b7e2"],"m":365},{"id":"alex_p15_366","t":"Kovalenko wrote: trade was closed last week","a":"bobyv87","d":"","n":"#366","p":15,"im":["d979f027e6b0bf1047fcf57124d6df61e95feedb"],"m":366},{"id":"alex_p15_367","t":"","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#367","p":15,"im":["12c048a92295d8edd9b808b653f5d0f9340b6865"],"m":367},{"id":"alex_p15_368","t":"I don't want to clog your journal Alex but I appreciate your thoughts....","a":"parnelli","d":"","n":"#368","p":15,"im":["8183b1532067903ed1921dfcd8314e6af074e1d3","79dc94c3c2dfdf035860f0b4579d472f1d3cb41b"],"m":368},{"id":"alex_p15_369","t":"Hi Parnelli","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#369","p":15,"im":["36f8815d3c409c4043e8887e7a54d92d89cb59ae","d065ca312061f9e16f098f187ada01ac59dc09bb"],"m":369},{"id":"alex_p15_370","t":"Afternoon Alex,\n\nReally enjoy your journal, it's really helping me and initiating some of those well needed eureka moments.\n\nIs this the kind of set up you would look at taking a trade on?","a":"Rdk123","d":"","n":"#370","p":15,"im":[],"m":370},{"id":"alex_p15_371","t":"","a":"Rdk123","d":"","n":"#371","p":15,"im":["9c65f950034ee547ad992c9a0b346c4a2f01c381"],"m":371},{"id":"alex_p15_372","t":"Yes correct. DP is my love entry.","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#372","p"